    Published = '2026-09-28'
    Faq = @(
      @('Can one sticker work on hot and iced takeaway cups?', 'The artwork family can match, but test the proposed construction on the actual hot cup, sleeve and cold cup. Heat, condensation and surfaces create different conditions.'),
      @('Where should a cafe cup sticker go?', 'Use the final cup with lid and sleeve fitted. Keep the mark visible without covering the grip area, drink notes or lid seating.'),
      @('Can cup stickers replace drink identification?', 'Only if the workflow makes the drink variant clear. Many cafes still need a separate writable or printed order cue; test the hand-off with real staff before deciding.')
